      "correct": "We live in the south of the city.",
      "note": "Use **in** for a part inside a place and **to** for something outside it; **on** is not used here."
    },
    {
      "incorrect": "The town is ten miles to south.",
      "correct": "The town is ten miles to the south.",
      "note": "The noun needs **the** after **to**, **from**, and **in**."
